<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<!-- HSK patch: integrate VFE Pirates research into HSK's armor progression.
     Adds HSK prereqs to the VFE entry-level research projects so players must
     have progressed through HSK's armor tech tree before unlocking warcaskets.

     VFE Pirates internal chain (unchanged):
       VFEP_Warcaskets -> VFEP_AdvancedWarcaskets -> VFEP_SpecialisedWarcaskets
                       -> VFEP_SpacerWarcaskets (end of chain)

     HSK armor chain (reference):
       PlateArmor (B1) -> Armor_B2 -> Armor_C1 -> FlakArmor (C2)
                       -> Armor_D1 -> ReconArmor (E1) -> PoweredArmor (E2)
                       -> Armor_E3 -> CataphractArmor

     Gate mapping:
       VFEP_Warcaskets        (Industrial entry) prereq += FlakArmor (Armor_C2)
       VFEP_SpacerWarcaskets  (Spacer pinnacle)  prereq += PoweredArmor (Armor_E2)

     Result: player needs HSK FlakArmor before starting the warcasket tree, and
     HSK PoweredArmor before unlocking the spacer-tier endgame warcaskets. -->
<Patch>

  <!-- Add FlakArmor as additional prerequisite to the entry-level Warcaskets research. -->
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationAdd">
    <xpath>Defs/ResearchProjectDef[defName="VFEP_Warcaskets"]/prerequisites</xpath>
    <value>
      <li>FlakArmor</li>
    </value>
  </Operation>

  <!-- Add PoweredArmor as additional prerequisite to the spacer-tier Warcaskets research. -->
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationAdd">
    <xpath>Defs/ResearchProjectDef[defName="VFEP_SpacerWarcaskets"]/prerequisites</xpath>
    <value>
      <li>PoweredArmor</li>
    </value>
  </Operation>

</Patch>
